        "original_id": "b7cdb75f-0cbe-5964-b259-ea38e3f454e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Still Reigning, Reign in Blood\n- People: Slayer\n- Organizations: American Recordings, Kerrang!\n- Places: Augusta Civic Center\n- Events: Reign in Pain tour\n\nFacts:\n- Reign in Blood is the third studio album by the American thrash metal band Slayer.\n- Kerrang! described Reign in Blood as \"the heaviest album of all\".\n- Still Reigning is a live performance DVD by Slayer that was released in 2004 through American Recordings.\n- Still Reigning was filmed at the Augusta Civic Center on July 11, 2004.\n- Still Reigning showcases Slayer performing their 1986 album Reign in Blood in its entirety with the four original band members.\n- Still Reigning uses a set resembling Slayer's 1986 Reign in Pain tour stage setup.",
